  "content": "\n\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/cw/lolip_p\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/More content-000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=white\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Cz2sCWz5Wh\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865F2.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<h1>关于：</h1>\n<p><strong>你好，我是LoLip_p！我开发这款着色器是为了营造紧张诡异的氛围，非常适合恐怖主题整合包。如果它能被用于你的项目中，我将不胜荣幸。它内置了CRT屏幕遮罩、多种视频故障效果、噪点特效等。若某些效果不符合你的偏好，所有参数均可完全自定义，让你轻松开启或关闭各项设置。欢迎前往 <a href=\"https://patreon.com/lolip_p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 支持作者。</strong></p>\n<h3>截图：</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sAZ9WsJP/images/957b7b8e34b8a77f17b347a499c08a2052941c35.jpeg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<h2>相关链接：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Cz2sCWz5Wh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">Discord</span></a> （讨论交流、Bug反馈等）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lolip_p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">YouTube</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fLoLip_p_Community\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Telegram</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>安装着色器</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>下载支持安装着色器的客户端，例如 OptiFine 或 Iris</li>\n<li>下载本着色器包</li>\n<li>将着色器文件复制至 /.minecraft/shaderpacks 目录</li>\n<li>启动 Minecraft，依次点击 选项 --> 视频设置 --> 着色器</li>\n<li>选择 <strong>Cursed Fog</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>演示视频</h2>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 已移除嵌入内容：<a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fzdIKteyJ0YI\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/zdIKteyJ0YI</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.neyhost.com%252f%253fref%253dLOLIP30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b88f233b0b7819fa09603e3da40613cb199093f7_0.webp\" alt=\"NeyHost\"></a></p>",
